    "context.situation": "In this simulated authenticated portal, login attempts and report access may differ from normal activity. Compare them with legitimate staff activity and investigate the account and session flow.",
    "context.objective": "Practice distinguishing and linking login attempts, post-login session use, and access to business data. Check recorded application decisions instead of jumping to conclusions from failure counts or HTTP results.",
    "context.period": "2026/08/12 15:00:00–2026/08/12 15:09:20 UTC (observation window of the supplied logs; Japan time is UTC+9)",
