    "context.network": "Logical flow: client → Web front end → application authentication and session validation → authorized report operations. Treat source IP, account name, session ID, and request ID as different identifiers.",
    "context.normalBehavior.0": "Legitimate staff logins and report operations within their permissions provide the normal-activity comparison.",
    "context.normalBehavior.1": "A failed authentication request and a post-authentication request to a business function are separate events.",
    "context.normalBehavior.2": "Multiple requests from the same source do not necessarily share an account or session.",
    "context.logSources.0.description": "HTTP requests and responses. Check the source, requested URL, status, response size, and request_id.",
